{"id":"camarade","lemma":"camarade","pos":"noun","rank":2016,"glosses":["buddy, mate","comrade (companion or fellow socialist or communist)"],"ipa":"/ka.ma.ʁad/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b6/Fr-camarade.ogg/Fr-camarade.ogg.mp3","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"camarades"},"formAudio":{"camarades":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-camarades.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle est ma camarade de classe.","en":"She is my classmate.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/12425","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"class, type, group"}]},{"text":"Aimes-tu tes camarades de classe ?","en":"Do you like your classmates?","words":[{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"class, type, group"}]},{"text":"Je connais ta camarade de chambre.","en":"I know your roommate.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a room."}]},{"text":"Ce sont mes camarades de classe.","en":"They are my classmates.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"class, type, group"}]},{"text":"Lui et moi sommes camarades de classe.","en":"He and I are classmates.","words":[{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"class, type, group"}]}]}